### Tennis World - Get booking requests
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house-tennisworld/api/{{apiVersion}}/tennis-world/booking-requests
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}

### Tennis World - Get booking request by ID
GET {{SERVER}}/kame-house-tennisworld/api/{{apiVersion}}/tennis-world/booking-requests/{{id}}
Authorization: Basic {{USERNAME}} {{PASSWORD}}
